    "name": "The Elementalist Typing",
    "steam_appid": 3631020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Elementalist Typing is a tactical typing RPG featuring elemental magic.\u00a0 Hone your typing skills and sharpen your wits to defeat your enemies!\u00a0 Collect treasures to upgrade your wizard and turn your boring home into a fabulous wizards den!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring colorful hand-drawn pixel graphics and parallax scrolling 2D settings.\u00a0 Adventure through beautiful and spooky environments while fighting a host of varied enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles depend on your typing skill and wits.\u00a0 Successfully typing the target text will launch a basic attack from your currently selected element and gain you a bit of mana.\u00a0 Use your mana wisely to cast more powerful spells that can make all the difference when facing a tough boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A custom mad-lib engine generates endless typing variety with periodically hilarious results (grammar not strictly guaranteed).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a challenge that is right for you -- practice typing letters, words, or sentences of increasing length.\u00a0 The Elementalist Typing is intended to be family friendly fun for typists of all ages -- numerous options allow you to customize the typing practice to fit any skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 48 levels of challenge featuring 12 bosses!\u00a0 Or challenge yourself to see how far you can go in one of 8 endless runs that slowly ramp up the difficulty to really test your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make typing practice fun with The Elementalist Typing!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Elementalist Typing is a tactical typing RPG featuring elemental magic.\u00a0 Hone your typing skills and sharpen your wits to defeat your enemies!\u00a0 Collect treasures to upgrade your wizard and turn your boring home into a fabulous wizards den!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring colorful hand-drawn pixel graphics and parallax scrolling 2D settings.\u00a0 Adventure through beautiful and spooky environments while fighting a host of varied enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles depend on your typing skill and wits.\u00a0 Successfully typing the target text will launch a basic attack from your currently selected element and gain you a bit of mana.\u00a0 Use your mana wisely to cast more powerful spells that can make all the difference when facing a tough boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A custom mad-lib engine generates endless typing variety with periodically hilarious results (grammar not strictly guaranteed).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a challenge that is right for you -- practice typing letters, words, or sentences of increasing length.\u00a0 The Elementalist Typing is intended to be family friendly fun for typists of all ages -- numerous options allow you to customize the typing practice to fit any skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 48 levels of challenge featuring 12 bosses!\u00a0 Or challenge yourself to see how far you can go in one of 8 endless runs that slowly ramp up the difficulty to really test your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make typing practice fun with The Elementalist Typing!</p>",
    "short_description": "A tactical typing role-playing game to sharpen your typing skills! Featuring colorful hand-drawn pixel art and a unique mad-lib engine for endless typing variety! Upgrade your wizard and play tactically to defeat mighty foes and collect fabulous home decorations. Make typing practice fun!",
